# Nachos Skill Binary Manifest
#
# Declares how to install CLI binaries required by skills.
# The gateway Dockerfile processes this file at build time.
#
# Format:
#   <type>  <binary-name>  <install-target>
#
# Types:
#   npm   - npm install -g <install-target>
#   go    - CGO_ENABLED=0 go install <install-target>
#
# Skills that are API-only (figma, jira, composio-*) or use embedded
# tools (agent-browser via Playwright) don't need entries here.

# npm-based skills
npm   summarize   @steipete/summarize@0.11.1

# Go-based skills
go    gifgrep     github.com/steipete/gifgrep/cmd/gifgrep@latest
go    goplaces    github.com/steipete/goplaces/cmd/goplaces@latest
go    gog         github.com/steipete/gogcli/cmd/gog@latest
